notification-header-nexaboard-reply:
Echo notification header when someone replies to a thread. Parameters:
* $1 - the name of the user who replied;
* $3 - the subject of the thread.

notification-header-nexaboard-mention:
Echo notification header when someone mentions you on a board. Parameters:
* $1 - the name of the user who mentioned you;
* $3 - the username whose board the mention was on.
